<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping - Visakhapatnam Cargoes - Oct 28.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping - Visakhapatnam Cargoes - Oct 28.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
